<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fb9213f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-element_type="section" data-id="fb9213f">
<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-89fc38e" data-element_type="column" data-id="89fc38e">
<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-501d284 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-element_type="widget" data-id="501d284" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<div class="cmsmasters_column one_third" id="cmsmasters_column_jw7lt7i4om"><div class="cmsmasters_column_inner"><div class="cmsmasters_text"><p>Reddy’s Crisp speech was in admiration and support to cancer survivors and raised hope in patients fighting cancer. Encouraged and enchanted, Cancer Survivors joined Dr Reddy at the dais and shared their experience of fighting and surviving cancer. Ms. Bhramara spoke how she regained all her health back after completing her chemotherapy cycles. Ms. Jyoti, another cancer survivor spoke about the moral support and treatment she received from Dr. Reddy and his team of consultants at Apollo Cancer Hospital.</p></div></div></div> </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
